      "en": "But having the same spirit of faith, according to that which is written, “I believed, and therefore I spoke.” We also believe, and therefore we also speak,",
      "ko": "기록한바 내가 믿는 고로 말하였다 한 것 같이 우리가 같은 믿음의 마음을 가졌으니 우리도 믿는 고로 또한 말하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "8f3100aa14f3c8a396c35f2db7473f8a494b692b838b66a780889dcdef506c6c",
      "translation_text_hash": "b66db9055f7f7127be676b32ea923e973b272e3af1b8c98413a75e7b90afe05a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
